    "likely_right_file": "bhel/Part1.pdf",
    "likely_right_page": 85,
    "why": "Part1.pdf explicitly names PT-CW and PT-DM clarifiers and lists three pumps, which matches the baseline before the proposed reduction from three to two. Part4.pdf might already reflect the change or describe a different gravity filter system, though it is somewhat unclear from the short quotes alone.",
